gfLpad_gHMQ7kNvwFY3bRE&_nc_oc=AdqN5SoxgjtTJygCG5USqI8ryU5lUJOg-1F5XlrrB-rHYy-oFTHxwp80GXExj03cPCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNSJawnt0CpVDDajoUW9vva-LL9ANknq59UvYR4Xnrddg&oe=6AE4954E"}, "display_name": "Lunar Chrono - Demo Version", "keywords": ["space", "race", "speed", "fly", "arcade"], "long_description": "# Lunar Chrono \u2014 Demo Version (1.2.2)\n\nThe Lunar Chrono demo lets you experience the first scenario of the game and three of its main challenge modes. This version is designed to showcase the core of the gameplay: piloting, speed, and precision, before accessing the full experience.\n\nFULL VERSION HERE!\nhttps://www.meta.com/es-es/experiences/lunar-chrono/1326942803824815\n\n\n---\n\n## Content Included in the Demo\n\n - 3 challenge modes from the first scenario:**\n  - Chrono Mode\n  - Linear Portal Route\n  - Combo Mode (reduced version)\n  - Recent flight-control improvements and technical adjustments\n\n---\n\n\n### **Chrono Mode**\nThe classic time\u2011trial challenge. Fly your ship at maximum speed and aim for the best possible time.\n\n### **Portal Route Mode**\nFly through the portals in the correct order before time runs out. A challenge focused on precision and control.\n\n### **Combo Mode**\nA reduced version of the game\u2019s most dynamic mode. Each lap introduces a different challenge, forcing you to adapt quickly.\n\n---\n\n## What\u2019s Included in the Full Version?\n\nThe full version expands the experience with:\n\n- **4 complete scenarios**\n- **6 levels per scenario (more than 20 challenges)**\n- **Selective Portal Mode** (valid and invalid portals)\n- **Drone Mode** (enemy drones attack you during the race)\n- **Full Combo Mode** (all challenges combined lap by lap)\n- **Compete against other players\u2019 recorded runs.**\n\n---\n\n## Thank you for trying the demo\nIf you enjoy the experience, consider leaving a review and a comment \u2014 it greatly helps improve the game and future updates.\n", "short_description": "Race on planetary circuits at full speed across 4 settings and more than 20 unique challenges. Master each race, improve your times, and take on other drivers in Versus mode with real player ghosts. Will you be the fastest in the system?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.level04games.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Level04", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.level04games.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "38597683156544457"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1063666639749232_2142588550238971092_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=waOOnATr9msQ7kNvwHxt8HX&_nc_oc=AdrVlrBnzjbAI6Xkn4TcCzefXJxE4PosvHh9y9B88zfPrQF59rIi0CxGY_Sowl6CqLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOZu7W46qHr5CanGSOm1EQGDe7qrlSAbRpVO2olkFnKpg&oe=6AE49CBF"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Lunar Chrono - Demo Version", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Arcade", "id": "1592192974313489"}], "release_date": 1762729200, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "32577015265277973", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "32577015151944651", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "3830148030617381"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniHor.png", "id": "1725363341755599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819982_1725363345088932_6897243270258713829_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B5F6-IdVrRgQ7kNvwHWF6k5&_nc_oc=AdowLUnYcsBm1l1BBjgiejeOGp9IJNVHqrBPrI04Tw9A6aYttsx6cUdCCAmkQ8bfyvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO8iUY6P7dYviGdD2XQ5XsIutXUzLSrpa7OEl9f1MJppw&oe=6AE495CE"}, {"file_name": "MiniHor.png", "id": "1591503161833222", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1591503165166555_1302322335697551064_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2NqHZcC83LoQ7kNvwGAX3Fn&_nc_oc=AdrFWm9qb5hGyzdXeX28Zq0EUXRjniwaI6Nop9ilLfwfPU1bdWZR0omy7IiG6uuFUFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVqasy92-qFdexhzdgwDAChJt_ylSWFjWo4pAi9PBbZw&oe=6AE49FD2"}, {"file_name": "MiniHor.png", "id": "1392129285813933", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823324_1392129289147266_592036253530711438_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tRLEq6PuqNEQ7kNvwHNBv_3&_nc_oc=AdqiJuYeXasAFVK0F7T5ui5vlGJOWiLriJ1mtIh6RVrAM-HKS6lMiSS2egtlVEpDBVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMTma4rV0SivulaJUy5Z8d5WHbL6oj-t44zV5F0X6L2PQ&oe=6AE4BAA6"}, {"file_name": "Portada.png", "id": "838036075357868", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_838036078691201_1065049276748794333_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5zd8OuyjPFYQ7kNvwFVlEKw&_nc_oc=AdpyWhCsBBj80W6aKxM-7kHsFuu_9GqLaxI7zLms-sgKvUvl-IHN3k74cBpV9SATKQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVrym7JwEJo5SudJ5j_9YaO4dz7JiiT85jpA8s43OunQ&oe=6AE4C0B4"}]}, "id": "831232856744156", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lunar Chrono", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u00bfTienes lo que se necesita para dominar los cielos estelares? Lunar Chrono es un juego arcade de realidad virtual que te pone al mando de una nave espacial en fren\u00e9ticas carreras contrarreloj. Tu misi\u00f3n: atravesar cada portal espacial antes de que el cron\u00f3metro llegue a cero.\n\nAdvertencia: Esta es una versi\u00f3n de acceso anticipado. El juego est\u00e1 en desarrollo activo, y algunas actualizaciones futuras podr\u00edan restablecer tu progreso o afectar los datos guardados. Te recomendamos jugar teniendo esto en cuenta.\n\nTu opini\u00f3n importa: Estoy abierto a sugerencias, ideas y comentarios sobre el juego. Si tienes propuestas, \u00a1estar\u00e9 encantado de tenerlas en cuenta!\n\nLas pr\u00f3ximas actualizaciones incluir\u00e1n:\n\nSistema de leaderboard global para registrar los mejores tiempos de cada jugador\n- Nuevos niveles dentro de los escenarios existentes\n- M\u00e1s escenarios con estilos visuales y trazados \u00fanicos\n- Mejoras en la f\u00edsica de vuelo y ajustes de dificultad", "short_description": "Pilota tu nave a toda velocidad en carreras contrarreloj por circuitos gal\u00e1cticos. \u00a1Cruza cada puerta espacial antes de que el tiempo se agote!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniHor.png", "id": "4093947847531008", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_4093947850864341_353